 322  4291              ; update: HL = a number, three BCD bytes, with a copy of the three last sent
 323  4291              ; 256 bytes on; DE = the VRAM address of its first digit in the table at
 324  4291              ; $1800, bit 6 set -> each byte that differs from its copy sent to both
 325  4291              ; tables, and copied (chapter 40). Uses A, BC, DE, HL
